solution:
**Given:**

Principal (P) = ₹3500

Rate (R) = 6% per year

Time (T) = 4 years

**Formula used:**

Simple Interest (SI) = dfrac{P times R times T}{100} 

**Calculation:**

SI = dfrac{3500 times 6 times 4}{100} 

⇒ SI = dfrac{3500 times 24}{100} 

⇒ SI = dfrac{84000}{100} 

⇒ SI = 840

**∴ The correct answer is option (4).**
